{"docs":{"federations2.50":{"choices":[[{"kind":"tooltip","label":{"zh":"所有能前往[Root.Capital.System.GetName]星系的成员国均会被邀请参与联合行动。\n\n如果他们接受，他们必须投入资源建造纪念碑，这会增加联邦经验和[Root.GetName]的影响力。\n\n[Root.GetName]还可以选择在两个成员国中提升[Root.GetHegemonyEthos]的吸引力。\n\n如果这一提议遭到广泛拒绝，联邦团结度将会下降，[Root.GetName]会损失影响力。","en":"All member states with access to the [Root.Capital.System.GetName] system will be approached to take part in the joint operation.\n\nIf they accept, they will have to dedicate resources to a monument which will boost Federation Experience and the [Root.GetName]'s Influence.\n\nThe [Root.GetName] will also be able to choose to increase [Root.GetHegemonyEthos] attraction in two member states.\n\nIf the proposal is widely rejected, Federation Cohesion will decrease and the [Root.GetName] will lose Influence."},"key":"federations2.50.A.tooltip","gameText":true,"source":"events/federations_events_2.txt:1018"}],null]},"federations2.51":{"choices":[[{"kind":"opinion","label":{"zh":"对方对我方的态度修正「同意团结盛典」","en":"Opinion modifier \"Agreed to Celebration of Unity\""},"modifier":"opinion_hegemony_joint_action_agreed","source_def":"common/opinion_modifiers/00_opinion_modifiers_federation.txt:313","target":{"zh":"事件来源方","en":"the event source"},"source":"events/federations_events_2.txt:1119"},{"kind":"tooltip","label":{"zh":"所有能前往[From.Capital.System.GetName]星系的成员国均会被邀请参与联合行动。\n\n如果他们接受，他们必须投入资源建造纪念碑，这会增加联邦经验和[From.GetName]的影响力。\n\n[From.GetName]还可以选择在两个成员国中提升[From.GetHegemonyEthos]的吸引力。","en":"All member states with access to the [From.Capital.System.GetName] system will be approached to take part in the joint operation.\n\nIf they accept, they will have to dedicate resources to a monument which will boost Federation Experience and the [From.GetName]'s Influence.\n\nThe [From.GetName] will also be able to choose to increase [From.GetHegemonyEthos] attraction in two member states."},"key":"federations2.51.A.tooltip","gameText":true,"source":"events/federations_events_2.txt:1124"},{"kind":"toolt